Recommends: nginx, apache2
Suggests: apc-ups-monitor-doc
Description: APC UPS monitoring system with web interface
 APC UPS Monitor provides real-time monitoring, historical data logging, and
 a modern web interface for APC uninterruptible power supplies managed by
 apcupsd.
 .
 Features include:
  - Real-time UPS status monitoring
  - Historical data collection and charting
  - Battery performance tracking
  - Event logging and alerting
  - Web-based dashboard
  - REST API for integration
  - WebSocket support for real-time updates
 .
 This package provides the complete UPS monitoring system including
 the backend service and web interface.
